    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "John W",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110611126001777385064/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJBao1DNU1Id0E0xD0FHuxr6J5S06pZOWHhRNEac2dAZbuCLPMu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I had a def problem while unloading at Roberts .Than was towed to Rawals. They are friendly people of course. However they lack on keeping you up to date while waiting for the job to be done.\nHowever the job was done and I went on my way. 10 days later ,I had the similar def issue. Ended up at another mech in Richmond VA,the mechanic who had a look at that said the previous guy forgot to put the clamp back on that goes around the filter etc..which caused the harness to burn etc ...and def started to leak too badly as well and was told the def pump is damaged. That I think is sheer negligence.",
        "time": 1671661225,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "ارشيف ليبيا السياسي",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108998085224467217399/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKpxm1oZl6TBFZCIgkBRUUApFvVpTP1lQiOq4N2CpWNBmn3Sg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I had a problem with the air pressure system, and I tried to fix the problem in two workshops for two weeks, and unfortunately I lost a lot of time and money until I got lucky and was able to book an appointment with Rawal transport’s workshop, and finally I was able to return to work with my truck after the air pressure problem was fixed",
        "time": 1672556859,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jatt Trouble",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111481061518530969855/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIk5h9VTJBdEA-PUfL9gpq7wrTrXyDC_wbx74Ooy8JYyDYTxA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Had issues with my Reffer they fixed it with 30 minutes,  highly recommend.",
        "time": 1762571868,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kevin Dean",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110666734171862663834/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVSoxSBsbphoaAC-ZkcZadP4i-d6tknxmYrWPntvAa8ZA8yS7lV_w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Exceptional service, very knowledgeable and equipped with the latest diagnostic tools and superb mechanics to rectify any issue with any kind of engine or truck. Been working with them for many years now, and never been disappointed.",
        "time": 1621036528,
        "translated": false
      },
